{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本話題電影《哥斯拉-0.0》，本月初在日本、美國等地上映後票房凌厲，日本累積票房已超過40億日圓（約2億港元），全球票房更突破150億日圓(約7.4億港元)。</p><p>兩位主角神木隆之介與濱邊美波，昨日(17日)便聯同「哥斯拉」現身東京新宿的戲院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.106696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:50:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076639+00:00","content_hash":"0ab5d05dc0b3e2d8b09384fb8790221eb6b3ccfde5b131220773f6b124e1c0bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}